	<<npc Wren>><<person1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>>
	"Well look who it is," says a voice to your right. <span class="gold">It's Wren.</span> <<He>> smiles at you from the bar. "Fancy a drink?"
	<br><br>

	Before you can respond, you hear a shout behind you. "Wren." A <<person2>><<person>> steps closer, flanked by a <<person3>><<person>> and <<person4>><<person>>.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Smuggler Pub Wren Intro]]>><<set $smuggler_pub_wren to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $debug is 1>>
