:: Smuggler Pub Wren Loft
<<effects>>

Wren listens as you tell <<him>> about the loft, including Bailey's aversion to it. <<He>> looks around, as if concerned about eavesdroppers.
<br><br>

"It's hard to believe old Bailey is scared of anything. The loft sounds like the perfect place to hide illicit things." <<He>> spreads <<his>> hands. "I fear I've nothing I could provide that would fit up there. I'm more in the business of moving illicit goods. There, I think I can help."
<br><br>

<<He>> smiles at you, a smile so innocent and disarming that, for a moment, you forget you're talking with a hardened criminal. <span class="gold">"There'll be something waiting for you at the orphanage.</span> No charge. Just something little, but I've found it handy in the past."
